an><br><br>...a CAPTIVATING STORY for the ages! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245210/extras/f9c7f4f0771a14fbb8311aeb6bb2e70d.avif?t=1728389996\" width=240 height=120 /></span><br><br>...SECRETS and CUSTOMIZATION options!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245210/extras/c17fb4f52f264927f8baa3130c32c1bf.avif?t=1728389996\" width=240 height=120 /></span><br><br>...3 JAMMING SOUNDTRACKS?!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245210/extras/760434045c85a40e1c5017abb3c10942.avif?t=1728389996\" width=240 height=120 /></span><br><br><br>Reclaim your Second Chance in... <strong>VIRULENT VESSELS: THE LEGEND OF GOBBLEDYGUNK!</strong>",
    "short_description": "Virulent Vessels is a turn-based strategy game where you fight against waves of enemies in a chess-like battle royale, each of them aiming to leave Land of the Dead! Each foe has a tricky pattern for you to learn over the course of two campaigns, and an Endless mode. Reclaim your second chance!",
